  "details": "VRSnapshot would be a feature where people would be able to go on old versions of worlds kind of like how you can on the wayback machine website. It would be useful for people that either liked older versions of worlds, or just curious about a development about a world without bugging the creator. Good for preservation too.\n\nYou can also warn of how older versions might be unstable, however it would be nice to either set it up so you can use it via website? or do it in game where you pick a version of a world, like what you can do when picking a version on steam.",
